From 61ba21da62ce8ca71c5b8c8756cbede963360dc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thampan <joby.thampan@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 11:04:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-338: PCE rule update api for Enable/Disable or
 Rewrite added 		-include vlan_aware flag as part of instance
 capability for PRX platform, checkpatch fix 		-Enhanced code to have
 delete and add from both Bridge and BridgePort                 -Proc for Pce
 Index and Pce Status added to the vlan proc dump                 -Bridge FiD
 if update later update the PCE rule properly                 -Pce Index
 display in VLAN changed to real HW index

---
